  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut potato into fries. Place fries on the lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt, All-American spice blend and toss to coat.\n• Bake until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/697ad7a29629deb2e47d875f/step-a77a6600.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, slice brown onion into 1cm-thick rounds, then separate into rings.\n• In a second medium bowl, combine the plain flour and a generous pinch of pepper. Add onion, tossing to coat.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a generous drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• When oil is hot, shake off excess flour, then cook onion (in batches), turning occasionally, until browned and slightly crispy, 5-7 mins. Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/697ad7a29629deb2e47d875f/step-6455a410.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Pat haloumi dry, then slice horizontally to get 1 piece per person.\n• Wash and dry frying pan, then return to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 2 mins each side.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/697ad7a29629deb2e47d875f/step-cab00c20.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, halve continental rolls and bake directly on a wire oven rack until heated through, 2-3 mins.\n• Thinly slice tomato into rounds.\n• Spread continental rolls with some plant-based smokey aioli. Top with mixed salad leaves, tomato, haloumi and onion rings.\n• Serve with fries, remaining aioli and hot sauce.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/697ad7a29629deb2e47d875f/step-dcbdf830.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
